TI  - Biopolymer-Based Formulations of &lt;i&gt;Beauveria bassiana&lt;/i&gt; for Biological Control of the Cabbage Whitefly (&lt;i&gt;Aleyrodes proletella&lt;/i&gt;)
AU  - Spasova, Mariya
