TI  - The basic leucine zipper domain (bZIP) transcription factor &lt;i&gt;BbYap1&lt;/i&gt; promotes evasion of host humoral immunity and regulates lipid homeostasis contributing to fungal virulence in &lt;i&gt;Beauveria bassiana&lt;/i&gt;
