TI  - Endophytic colonization of tomato by Beauveria bassiana decreased the fitness and altered the feeding behaviour of the whitefly Bemisia tabaci
AU  - Wang, Xian
AU  - Wang, Ziying
AU  - Yuan, Qian
AU  - Yan, Ganwei
