TI  - Bioefficacy of engineered <i>Beauveria bassiana</i> with scorpion neurotoxin, LqqIT1 against cotton mealybug, <i>Phenacoccus solenopsis</i> and cowpea aphid, <i>Aphis craccivora</i>
