TI  - Integration of Repellency Effect of Neem-Based Insecticide and Pheromone Bio-Trap® with Beauveria bassiana (Hypocreales: Cordycipitaceae) to Control the Red Palm Weevil, Rhynchophorus ferrugineus (Olivier) (Coleoptera: Curculionidae)
