TI  - High susceptibility of <i>Tetranychus merganser</i> (Acari: Tetranychidae), an emergent pest of the tropical crop <i>Carica papaya</i>, towards <i>Metarhizium anisopliae s.l.</i> and <i>Beauveria bassiana</i> strains
AU  - Alfaro-Valle, Elizabeth
