TI  - Noteworthy Bio Resource Utilization and Eco-Friendly Bioconversion Approaches of Versatile Invasive Aquatic Weed Water Hyacinth (Eichhornia Crassipes) Biomass - A Green Strategy for Aquatic Environmental Safety and Management of Aquatic Weeds
AU  - Selvaraj, Karthick Raja Namasivayam
AU  - Vigneshwaraprakash, Lakshmanan
AU  - Arvindbharani, Rajansowri
