TI  - Transcriptome Analysis of the Fat Body of the Maize Pest Delphacodes kuscheli (Hemiptera: Delphacidae) Reveals Essential Roles of Fungal Endosymbionts
AU  - Pascual, Agustina
AU  - Calabresi, Franco
