TI  - First record of <i>Aspergillus nomiae</i> as a broad-spectrum entomopathogenic fungus that provides resistance against phytopathogens and insect pests by colonization of plants
AU  - Zhang, Zhengkun
AU  - Tian, Yifan
AU  - Sui, Li
AU  - Lu, Yang
AU  - Cheng, Ke
AU  - Zhao, Yu
AU  - Li, Qiyun
