TI  - Mortality Effects of Three Bacterial Pathogens and Beauveria bassiana When Topically Applied or Injected Into House Flies (Diptera: Muscidae)
AU  - Johnson, Dana M
AU  - Weeks, Emma N I
AU  - LoVullo, Eric D
AU  - Shirk, Paul D
AU  - Geden, Christopher J
