TI  - Ethanol-Enriched Substrate Facilitates Ambrosia Beetle Fungi, but Inhibits Their Pathogens and Fungal Symbionts of Bark Beetles
AU  - Lehenberger, Maximilian
AU  - Benkert, Markus
AU  - Biedermann, Peter H W
