TI  - The entomopathogenic fungal endophytes Purpureocillium lilacinum (formerly Paecilomyces lilacinus) and Beauveria bassiana negatively affect cotton aphid reproduction under both greenhouse and field conditions
AU  - Castillo Lopez, Diana
AU  - Zhu-Salzman, Keyan
AU  - Ek-Ramos, Maria Julissa
AU  - Sword, Gregory A
IS  - 8
VL  - 9
