TI  - Ubiquity of insect-derived nitrogen transfer to plants by endophytic insect-pathogenic fungi: an additional branch of the soil nitrogen cycle
AU  - Behie, Scott W
AU  - Bidochka, Michael J
IS  - 5
VL  - 80
DA  - 2014/03//
PY  - 2014
JO  - Applied and environmental microbiology
J2  - Appl Environ Microbiol
