TI  - A Histone Deacetylase, Magnaporthe oryzae RPD3, Regulates Reproduction and Pathogenic Development in the Rice Blast Fungus
AU  - Lee, Song Hee
AU  - Farh, Mohamed El-Agamy
AU  - Lee, Jaejoon
AU  - Oh, Young Taek
AU  - Cho, Eunbyeol
AU  - Park, Jiyeun
AU  - Son, Hokyoung
