TI  - Neem oil increases the persistence of the entomopathogenic fungus Metarhizium anisopliae for the control of Aedes aegypti (Diptera: Culicidae) larvae
AU  - Paula, Adriano R
AU  - Ribeiro, Anderson
AU  - Lemos, Francisco José Alves
AU  - Silva, Carlos P
AU  - Samuels, Richard I
