TI  - Metarhizium robertsii ammonium permeases (MepC and Mep2) contribute to rhizoplane colonization and modulates the transfer of insect derived nitrogen to plants
AU  - Moonjely, Soumya
AU  - Zhang, Xing
AU  - Fang, Weiguo
AU  - Bidochka, Michael J
IS  - 10
