TI  - High Ozone (O<sub>3</sub>) Affects the Fitness Associated with the Microbial Composition and Abundance of Q Biotype <i>Bemisia tabaci</i>
AU  - Hong, Yanyun
AU  - Yi, Tuyong
AU  - Tan, Xiaoling
AU  - Zhao, Zihua
AU  - Ge, Feng
VL  - 7
DA  - 2016///
PY  - 2016
T2  - Frontiers in microbiology
