TI  - Sprays of emulsifiable Beauveria bassiana formulation are ovicidal towards Tetranychus urticae (Acari: Tetranychidae) at various regimes of temperature and humidity
AU  - Shi, Wei-Bing
AU  - Feng, Ming-Guang
AU  - Liu, Shu-Sheng
