TI  - Red- and Blue-Light Sensing in the Plant Pathogen Alternaria alternata Depends on Phytochrome and the White-Collar Protein LreA
AU  - Igbalajobi, Olumuyiwa
AU  - Yu, Zhenzhong
AU  - Fischer, Reinhard
IS  - 2
VL  - 10
DA  - 2019/04//
PY  - 2019
T2  - mBio
