TI  - Defeated by the nines: nine extracellular strategies to avoid microbe-associated molecular patterns recognition in plants
AU  - Buscaill, Pierre
AU  - van der Hoorn, Renier A L
IS  - 7
VL  - 33
DA  - 2021/08//
PY  - 2021
JO  - The Plant cell
J2  - Plant Cell
