TI  - Danthron, an Anthraquinone Isolated from a Marine Fungus, Is a New Inhibitor of Angiogenesis Exhibiting Interesting Antitumor and Antioxidant Properties
AU  - Vidal, Isabel
AU  - Torres-Vargas, José Antonio
AU  - Sánchez, José María
AU  - Trigal, Mónica
