TI  - Genome sequence and comparative analysis of clavicipitaceous insect-pathogenic fungus Aschersonia badia with Metarhizium spp
AU  - Agrawal, Yamini
AU  - Narwani, Tarun
AU  - Subramanian, Srikrishna
VL  - 17
