TI  - Agroforestry coffee soils increase the insect-suppressive potential offered by entomopathogenic fungi over full-sun soils: A case proposing a "bait survival technique"
AU  - Moreira, Camila Costa
AU  - Celestino, Daiane
AU  - Guerra Sobrinho, Tathiana
AU  - Cardoso, Irene Maria
AU  - Elliot, Simon Luke
