AB  - The invention discloses a high efficiency capillitium fungi acaricide which can effectively control phytophagous harmful mites, reduce the usage of chemical pesticides and improve the safety of agricultural products. The scarab Metarrhizium anisopliae ZJUIM24-562S strain and sorosphere Beauveria bassiana ZJUIM17-340 strain of the invention are preserved on February 25, 2008 and the preserve codes separately are CGMCC No.2375 and CGMCC No.2374. The preparation comprises capillitium fungi conidium, mineral oil, emulsifying agent, uv-protector and stabilizer. The results of indoor and outdoor tests show that capillitium fungi acaricide has ideal extermination activity and field control efficiency for various phytophagous harmful mites. Therefore, the high efficiency capillitium fungi acaricide will fill the study knowledge and technical gaps of fungi acaricide in China.
