TI  - Juruin: an antifungal peptide from the venom of the Amazonian Pink Toe spider, Avicularia juruensis, which contains the inhibitory cystine knot motif
AU  - Ayroza, Gabriela
AU  - Ferreira, Ivan L C
AU  - Sayegh, Raphael S R
AU  - Tashima, Alexandre K
AU  - da Silva Junior, Pedro I
VL  - 3
