TI  - Circadian oscillations in &lt;i&gt;Trichoderma atroviride&lt;/i&gt; and the role of core clock components in secondary metabolism, development, and mycoparasitism against the phytopathogen &lt;i&gt;Botrytis cinerea&lt;/i&gt;
AU  - Henríquez-Urrutia, Marlene
