TI  - Functional Coupling between the Unfolded Protein Response and Endoplasmic Reticulum/Golgi Ca<sup>2+</sup>-ATPases Promotes Stress Tolerance, Cell Wall Biosynthesis, and Virulence of Aspergillus fumigatus
AU  - Weichert, Martin
AU  - Guirao-Abad, José
AU  - Aimanianda, Vishukumar
