TI  - Laboratory Investigations Reveal that Harmonia axyridis (Coleoptera: Coccinellidae) Is a Poor Host for Dinocampus coccinellae (Hymenoptera: Braconidae) in Brazil
AU  - de Castro-Guedes, CamilaFediuk
AU  - de Almeida, LúciaMassutti
