TI  - Susceptibility of adult female Aedes aegypti (Diptera: Culicidae) to the entomopathogenic fungus Metarhizium anisopliae is modified following blood feeding
AU  - Paula, Adriano R
AU  - Carolino, Aline T
AU  - Silva, Carlos P
