TI  - Bacterial symbionts in insects or the story of communities affecting communities
AU  - Ferrari, Julia
AU  - Vavre, Fabrice
IS  - 1569
VL  - 366
DA  - 2011/05//
PY  - 2011
JO  - Philosophical transactions of the Royal Society of London. Series B, Biological sciences
