TI  - Analysis of the complete mitochondrial genome of Pochonia chlamydosporia suggests a close relationship to the invertebrate-pathogenic fungi in Hypocreales
AU  - Lin, Runmao
AU  - Liu, Chichuan
AU  - Shen, Baoming
AU  - Bai, Miao
AU  - Ling, Jian
AU  - Chen, Guohua
AU  - Mao, Zhenchuan
AU  - Cheng, Xinyue
AU  - Xie, Bingyan
