TI  - The microbe-free plant: fact or artifact?
AU  - Partida-Martínez, Laila P
AU  - Heil, Martin
VL  - 2
DA  - 2011///
PY  - 2011
T2  - Frontiers in plant science
J2  - Front Plant Sci
